      "text": "5. Reservation items refer to physical units from one supplier. startDate and returnDate are both inclusive.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. Reservation items refer to physical units from one supplier. startDate and returnDate are both inclusive.",
